msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/linkNextAcyclicity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:linkNext admits no cycle; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:linkNext 不允许任何环 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/linkNextAcyclicity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a cycle is a legitimate shape — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当环是一种合法结构时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/linkNextAcyclicity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
